# check_refs.allow -- paths that are created at run time or by the user, not shipped.
# One path per line; a tab, then the reason.
.claude/memory-hot.md	generated by scripts/generate_memory_hot.py at every session start
.claude/rules/voice-banlist.md	written by the user from voice-banlist.example.md; hooks stay inert without it
Database/team.db	created at install from Database/schema.sql (docs/install.md)
Database/backups/	created on the first backup; holds copies of team.db under a retention window
Database/clinical.db	example name of an optional separate health database
Database/genesis_config.json	written by the /genesis skill on first run
Team/orchestrator.md	written by the /genesis skill on first run
Team/roster.md	written by the /genesis skill and kept by the hiring pipeline
